request.description:
Retrieve all chat rooms the authenticated user is a participant in, including unread counts and room statistics.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: initial_data**: Sent on WebSocket connection with user's rooms and data.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('initial_data', (data) => {
    console.log('User rooms:', data.rooms);
    console.log('User info:', data.user);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (React Hook):**
```typescript
import { useChat } from './hooks/useChat';
const { rooms } = useChat(token);
useEffect(() => {
  // Display rooms in UI
  console.log('Rooms:', rooms);
}, [rooms]);
```

Create a new group chat room with specified settings and automatically join the creator as admin.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: room_joined**: Confirmation of joining the newly created room.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('room_joined', (data) => {
    console.log('Joined room:', data.room);
    console.log('Recent messages:', data.messages);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function createRoom() {
  const roomData = {
    name: "Medical Team Discussion",
    description: "Chat for medical team coordination",
    type: "group",
    isPrivate: false,
    maxParticipants: 25,
    settings: { allowFileSharing: true, messageDeletionAllowed: true },
    metadata: { department: "cardiology" }
  };
  const response = await chatService.createRoom(roomData);
  console.log('Created room:', response.data);
}
```

Create or retrieve an existing direct chat between two users.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: room_joined**: Confirmation of joining the direct chat room.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('room_joined', (data) => {
    console.log('Joined direct chat:', data.room);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function startDirectChat() {
  const response = await chatService.createDirectChat("user456");
  console.log('Direct chat:', response.data);
}
```

Retrieve detailed information about a specific chat room, including participants and settings.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: room_updated**: Notifies when room information is updated.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('room_updated', (data) => {
    console.log('Room updated:', data.roomId);
    console.log('Last message:', data.lastMessage);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function getRoomDetails(roomId) {
  const response = await chatService.request(`/api/chat/rooms/${roomId}`);
  console.log('Room details:', response.data);
}
```

Join an existing chat room as a participant.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: join_room**: Client emits to join a chat room.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('join_room', { roomId: 'room-uuid' });
  ```
- **Event: room_joined**: Confirmation of joining the room.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('room_joined', (data) => {
    console.log('Joined room:', data.room);
  });
  ```
- **Event: user_joined_room**: Notifies others when a user joins.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('user_joined_room', (data) => {
    console.log(`${data.user.name} joined room ${data.roomId}`);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (React Hook):**
```typescript
const { joinRoom } = useChat(token);
useEffect(() => {
  joinRoom(roomId);
}, [roomId]);
```

Leave a chat room and become an inactive participant.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: leave_room**: Client emits to leave a chat room.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('leave_room', { roomId: 'room-uuid' });
  ```
- **Event: room_left**: Confirmation of leaving the room.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('room_left', (data) => {
    console.log('Left room:', data.roomId);
  });
  ```
- **Event: user_left_room**: Notifies others when a user leaves.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('user_left_room', (data) => {
    console.log(`User ${data.userId} left room ${data.roomId}`);
  });
 ```
**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function leaveRoom(roomId) {
  await chatService.request(`/api/chat/rooms/${roomId}/leave`, { method: 'POST' });
  console.log('Left room:', roomId);
}
```

Retrieve a list of active participants in a chat room.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: user_joined_room**: Notifies when a new participant joins.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('user_joined_room', (data) => {
    console.log(`${data.user.name} joined room ${data.roomId}`);
  });
  ```
- **Event: user_left_room**: Notifies when a participant leaves.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('user_left_room', (data) => {
    console.log(`User ${data.userId} left room ${data.roomId}`);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function getParticipants(roomId) {
  const response = await chatService.request(`/api/chat/rooms/${roomId}/participants`);
  console.log('Participants:', response.data);
}
```

Retrieve messages from a chat room with pagination and filtering options.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: new_message**: Notifies when a new message is received.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('new_message', (message) => {
    console.log('New message from:', message.sender.fullName);
    console.log('Content:', message.content);
    displayMessage(message);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function fetchMessages(roomId) {
  const response = await chatService.getMessages(roomId, { limit: 50 });
  console.log('Messages:', response.data);
}
```

Send a new message to a chat room.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: send_message**: Client emits to send a message.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('send_message', {
    roomId: 'room-uuid',
    content: 'Hello world',
    type: 'text',
    metadata: {},
    replyToId: 'message-uuid'
  });
  ```
- **Event: new_message**: Notifies when the message is received.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('new_message', (message) => {
    console.log('New message:', message.content);
    displayMessage(message);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (React Component):**
```typescript
const { sendMessage } = useChat(token);
const handleSendMessage = (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  sendMessage(roomId, newMessage);
  setNewMessage('');
};
```

Edit an existing message (only by the original sender).

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: edit_message**: Client emits to edit a message.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('edit_message', {
    messageId: 'message-uuid',
    content: 'Updated content'
  });
  ```
- **Event: message_edited**: Notifies when a message is edited.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('message_edited', (message) => {
    console.log('Message edited:', message.id);
    updateMessageInUI(message);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function editMessage(messageId, content) {
  const response = await chatService.editMessage(messageId, content);
  console.log('Edited message:', response.data);
}
```

Delete a message (soft delete by default, hard delete for admins).

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: delete_message**: Client emits to delete a message.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('delete_message', {
    messageId: 'message-uuid',
    soft: true
  });
  ```
- **Event: message_deleted**: Notifies when a message is deleted.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('message_deleted', (data) => {
    console.log('Message deleted:', data.messageId);
    if (data.soft) {
      markMessageAsDeleted(data.messageId);
    } else {
      removeMessageFrom oiseaux(data.messageId);
    }
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function deleteMessage(messageId, soft = true) {
  await chatService.deleteMessage(messageId, soft);
  console.log('Message deleted:', messageId);
}
```

Mark messages as read up to a specific message or all messages in a room.

**WebSocket Integration:**
- **Event: mark_read**: Client emits to mark messages as read.
  ```javascript
  socket.emit('mark_read', {
    roomId: 'room-uuid',
    messageId: 'message-uuid'
  });
  ```
- **Event: message_read**: Notifies when a message is read by someone.
  ```javascript
  socket.on('message_read', (data) => {
    console.log(`Message ${data.messageId} read by ${data.readBy}`);
    updateReadStatus(data.messageId, data.readBy);
  });
  ```

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function markMessagesRead(roomId, messageId) {
  await chatService.markAsRead(roomId, messageId);
  console.log('Messages marked as read');
}
```

Search for messages within a chat room.

**Frontend Example (API Service):**
```typescript
const chatService = new ChatAPIService('https://api.example.com', token);
async function searchMessages(roomId, query) {
  const response = await chatService.searchMessages(roomId, query, { limit: 20 });
  console.log('Search results:', response.data);
}
```
